{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03766","headline":"和韦承庆过义阳公主山池五首 一 · 杜审言","name":"和韦承庆过义阳公主山池五首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"野兴城中发，朝英物外求。\n情悬朱绂望，契动赤泉游。\n海燕巢书阁，山鸡舞画楼。\n雨余清晚夏，共坐北岩幽。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜审言","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03766.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03766","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}